
# GBP AI Agent
## Product Requirements Document (PRD)

Version: 1.0  
Status: Draft  
Product Type: SaaS + Mobile Application  
Platform: Web + iOS + Android

---

# Executive Summary

GBP AI Agent is an AI-powered Google Business Profile (GBP) growth platform designed to help local businesses, agencies, and enterprises manage reviews, automate content publishing, improve local SEO, monitor competitors, and increase customer engagement.

The platform goes beyond traditional review management tools by providing actionable AI-driven business insights and growth recommendations.

---

# Product Vision

Empower every local business to become discoverable, trusted, and highly rated on Google through intelligent automation and AI-powered growth tools.

